#. i18n: file: kplayersettingshue.ui:318
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QComboBox, c_hue_every)
#: rc.cpp:2433 rc.cpp:2442 rc.cpp:2448 rc.cpp:2457 rc.cpp:2463
